# Trivy vulnerability suppression file.
#
# When adding a suppression, keep the format:
#   # <package>: <what the CVE is and why the risk is accepted>
#   CVE-XXXX-YYYY exp:YYYY-MM-DD
#
# Always set an expiry date so the suppression is revisited instead of
# silently outliving the base image it was written for.
# See: https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/
